Author: cafebedouin <cafebedouin@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 14:32:42 2026 -0500

    Say in the ADProofs announcement comment that proofs are regenerated for the last adProofsSuffixLength blocks
    
    UtxoState generates them only for blocks within adProofsSuffixLength of the headers tip (UtxoState.scala:197). Comment
    only.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

